cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "HFW-NPO: A Dual Paradigm Hybrid Filter-Wrapper Nomadic People Optimizer for High-Dimensional Alzheimer's Gene Expression Classification"
abstract: >
  A three-stage feature selection pipeline for high-dimensional Alzheimer's
  disease gene expression microarray data. Combines a tri-criterion hybrid
  filter (Fisher Discriminant Ratio + Mutual Information + Welch t-test)
  aggregated via an omega-score, intra-fold SMOTE balancing, a Binary
  Nomadic People Optimizer wrapper with adaptive Lévy-scale anti-stagnation
  mechanism and hill-climbing local search, and a five-member soft-voting
  ensemble (ExtraTrees + SVM-RBF + Logistic Regression + Random Forest +
  Gradient Boosting). Evaluated on four GEO datasets (GSE33000, GSE132903,
  GSE63060+GSE63061, GSE122063) under a dual-paradigm protocol.
